on the Forever maps. Quest text © Blizzard Entertainment.","narrative":{"details":"The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters.  Great is his strength, and solemn his pride.  The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number.\n\nBut I do not fear him.  I am grateful he is here.  He is a worthy challenge, and honorable prey.\n\nIf you are ready, then swim out and search for Isha Awak, the Deep Doom.\n\nHis spirit dwells in his heart, and to hear its beat is to know your fate.","objectives":"Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.","offerRewardText":"You now are one with Isha Awak, adventurer. His spirit is with you. He lurks in your eyes...\n\nEyes that, one day, will learn to see.","requestItemsText":"Fear not the waters, friend.","endText":null,"objectiveText":[]},"narrativeSource":"cmangos","prevQuest":{"id":874,"name":"Mahren Skyseer"},"nextQuest":null,"nextQuestInChain":null,"giverName":"Mahren Skyseer","turnInName":"Mahren Skyseer","startItemText":null,"startNpcs":[{"name":"Mahren Skyseer","zone":"The Barrens","x":65.8,"y":43.9}],"endNpcs":[{"name":"Mahren Skyseer","zone":"The Barrens","x":65.8,"y":43.9}],"reputation":[{"faction":"Thunder Bluff","factionId":null,"amount":150}],"mentionedItems":[],"mapGroups":[{"zoneId":17,"zoneName":"The Barrens","continent":"kalimdor","imageUrl":"/images/zone-maps/17.jpg","markers":[{"kind":"start","npcName":"Mahren Skyseer","xPct":65.8,"yPct":43.9},{"kind":"end","npcName":"Mahren Skyseer","xPct":65.8,"yPct":43.9}]}],"chain":{"subtitle":"13 quests from level 10 to 27, 15,375 XP in all.","steps":[{"stepNumber":1,"isCurrentStep":false,"quests":[{"questId":861,"name":"The Hunter's Way","isCurrent":false,"level":"10","objectiveText":"Bring 4 Flatland Prowler Claws to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.","giverName":"Skorn Whitecloud","giverZone":"Mulgore","xpText":"850 XP","rewardItem":{"itemId":null,"href":null,"icon":"","name":null,"quality":null,"qty":1},"variants":null}]},{"stepNumber":2,"isCurre